{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>MUJI新上架嘅「無糖牛奶咖啡濃縮液」最近成為人氣商品！選用巴西同印尼產嘅優質咖啡豆調配而成，保留咖啡豆嘅醇厚香氣與濃郁口感，加上完全無添加糖嘅健康配方，控糖同減脂期飲都完全零負擔！呢款濃縮液採用3倍稀釋黃金比例，只需按個人喜好倒入少少，再加牛奶即可1秒沖出濃淡合宜嘅 Latte，一盒$38可以用到好多次，好抵！MUJI同步推出低咖啡因無糖版本，就算關注咖啡因攝取、夜晚想飲一杯都冇問題～</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741463722868062_645210756a89c86dede58.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741463969359796_546771576a89c87068211.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741464274632023_5881770626a89c8741dd1e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741464638968078_9499606776a89c87784b35.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741464910338103_20907937676a89c8799da81.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178741465111314300_4391182656a89c87bee21e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T16:19:05.284219+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}